flowchart TB
    User(["You"]) --> CRO["CRO<br/>Orchestration layer<br/>(local-first, MCP-facing)"]
    User --> SKILL["A skill<br/>(reads its own repo directly)"]
    SKILL <--> CRO

    CRO --> TB["TheBrain<br/>Durable knowledge<br/>Evidence, Notes, attachments,<br/>meaningful graph relationships"]
    CRO --> OB1["OB1<br/>Semantic thought history<br/>Ideas, observations, tasks,<br/>references, person notes<br/>(local, Docker)"]
    CRO --> PLANE["Plane<br/>Tasks and work-item detail<br/>(local, Docker)"]
    SKILL --> REPO["Project Repositories<br/>Project work and canon<br/>(CRO never reads/writes this directly)"]

    CRO -. "disposable index only<br/>(cro_index, cro_runtime)" .-> CRO

